--- OVERVIEW: PMF_react_TS1_beta ---

Same reactant->TS1 SMD -> Umbrella-Sampling -> WHAM pipeline as ../PMF_react_TS1_alpha/, run
independently for the beta protonation isomer. Unlike alpha, this branch includes its own
'react_generation/' step producing rep1's starting TS1-region configuration locally (alpha's
equivalent starting point was not generated inside this folder).

--- react_generation/ ---
Generates the reactant/TS1 starting configuration via an initial SMD run before the SMD/
stage below -- see react_generation/README.

--- SMD/ ---
Steered MD along 'dD' (same AT0=-2.0/AT1=2.0/KAPPA=400 as alpha) generating the
umbrella-sampling seeds -- see SMD/README.

--- US/ ---
100-window umbrella sampling along 'dD' -- see US/README.

--- WHAM_files/ ---
Own copy of the shared WHAM scripts (separate from alpha's) -- see WHAM_files/README.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
